	["Cast {spell:18960}. {npc:11802} stands upstairs in his building in {area:2361}: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart. Shrine Baubles lie in the containers on the floor of {area:656}, below {area:2361}: take one to the {area:2362} in the north-west, use it there and speak to {npc:11799}. Then fly back to {area:442} from {area:2361}."] = "施放{spell:18960}。{npc:11802}在{area:2361}他那栋楼的楼上：从里面上楼，箭头分不清楼层。神龛饰品放在{area:656}的地面容器里，位于{area:2361}下方：拿一个到西北的{area:2362}，在那里使用并和{npc:11799}交谈。然后从{area:2361}飞回{area:442}。",
