	["{item:1006}, from {npc:330}"] = "{item:1006}，来自{npc:330}",
	["{item:1256}, from the murlocs of {area:18}"] = "{item:1256}，来自{area:18}的鱼人",
	["{item:13194}, from {npc:11075}"] = "{item:13194}，来自{npc:11075}",
	["{item:14047} drops from humanoids level 50 and up: the Scourge cultists and Scarlet Crusade in the Plaguelands, the Deadwood furbolgs of {zone:1448}, the Winterfall furbolgs of {zone:1452}. Keep any {item:14047} past the first 60: it all goes to {quest:7796} later."] = "{item:14047}由50级以上人形生物掉落：瘟疫之地的天灾教徒与血色十字军、{zone:1448}的枯木熊怪、{zone:1452}的冬泉熊怪。前60个之外的多余{item:14047}都留着：之后都会交给{quest:7796}。",
	["{item:1931}, from {npc:448}"] = "{item:1931}，来自{npc:448}",
	["{item:247834}, from the kobolds"] = "{item:247834}，来自狗头人",
	["{item:2592}: Defias, gnolls and kobolds in {zone:1436} and Redridge"] = "{item:2592}：{zone:1436}和赤脊山的迪菲亚、豺狼人与狗头人",
	["{item:4306} drops from humanoids level 23 to 40: Syndicate in Alterac and Arathi, the Defias of Duskwood's {area:94}, Stranglethorn's trolls."] = "{item:4306}由23到40级人形生物掉落：奥特兰克和阿拉希的辛迪加、暮色森林{area:94}的迪菲亚、荆棘谷的巨魔。",
	["{item:4338} drops from humanoids level 35 to 50: the Dunemaul ogres of {zone:1446}, the Hatecrest naga of {zone:1444}, the Shadowforge dwarves of the {zone:1418}."] = "{item:4338}由35到50级人形生物掉落：{zone:1446}的砂槌食人魔、{zone:1444}的仇恨之冠纳迦、{zone:1418}的暗炉矮人。",
	["{item:780}, from the murlocs south of the bridge"] = "{item:780}，来自桥南的鱼人",
	["{item:782}, from the Riverpaw gnolls"] = "{item:782}，来自河爪豺狼人",
	["{item:981}, from {quest:87}"] = "{item:981}，来自{quest:87}",
	["{npc:10782} stands in the city hall on {object:2098}, beside {npc:1646}; {npc:3520} walks the canals."] = "{npc:10782}站在{object:2098}的市政厅里，{npc:1646}身旁；{npc:3520}在运河边行走。",
	["{npc:11056} in the camp also ends The Key to {area:2057} (200), after a longer chain that needs a {area:2057} group."] = "营地的{npc:11056}也能结束{area:2057}的钥匙（200点），但需要一条更长的任务链和{area:2057}的队伍。",
	["{npc:11076} guards the cauldron at the {area:202}, the farm east of {area:200}."] = "{npc:11076}守着{area:200}以东农场{area:202}的大锅。",
	["{npc:11077} guards the cauldron at {area:200}, north-east of {area:199}."] = "{npc:11077}守着{area:199}东北{area:200}的大锅。",
	["{npc:11078} guards the cauldron at {area:201}, in the east of the zone."] = "{npc:11078}守着区域东部{area:201}的大锅。",
	["{npc:14722} takes cloth for {faction:72}. The arrow leads to him; he stands upstairs inside his building. Each first donation of 60 Wool, Silk, Mageweave and {item:14047} pays 150 reputation once; after the {item:14047} one, {quest:7796} pays 50 for every 20 {item:14047}, as often as you like. The Auction House is the quickest source of cloth. In Classic, quests pay full reputation while they are at most 5 levels below you, so do Elwynn (levels 1-10), {zone:1436} (10-18), Redridge (15-25) and {zone:1431} (20-30) while you level through them. After the donations come the level 52-58 quests of the {zone:1422} and the {zone:1428} (about 1,150), then the optional low-level hubs, best rate first: Northshire and the city errands (about 40 a minute at full value), the {area:717} (30), Eastvale and {area:87} (25). Every {faction:72} gain also gives a quarter as much to {zone:1455}, {zone:1457} and the Gnomeregan Exiles, except quests in the level 1-10 start areas. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain."] = "{npc:14722}为{faction:72}收取布料。箭头会指向他；他站在自己那栋楼的楼上。首次上交60个毛料、丝绸、魔纹布和{item:14047}各给150点声望一次；交过{item:14047}之后，{quest:7796}每交20个{item:14047}给50点，次数不限。拍卖行是布料最快的来源。经典版中，任务在你高于其不超过5级时给全额声望，所以在你升级经过时做艾尔文森林（1-10级）、{zone:1436}（10-18级）、赤脊山（15-25级）和{zone:1431}（20-30级）。捐献之后是{zone:1422}和{zone:1428}的52-58级任务（约1150），然后再是可选的低级据点，按效率从高到低：北郡和城内跑腿（满额时每分钟约40）、{area:717}（30）、东谷与{area:87}（25）。每次获得{faction:72}声望时，{zone:1455}、{zone:1457}和诺莫瑞根流亡者也会得到四分之一的量，1-10级新手区任务除外。传承外交官最多使每次收益增加10%。",
	["{npc:14722}, the cloth quartermaster"] = "{npc:14722}，布料军需官",
	["{npc:1748} holds court in {object:2117} with {npc:1749} at his side: speak with her for the second of his quests."] = "{npc:1748}在{object:2117}主持朝政，{npc:1749}在他身旁：与她交谈接取他的第二个任务。",
	["{npc:240} stands in front of the Lion's Pride Inn in {area:87}. The Lost Books drop from the kobolds of {area:57} south of {area:87}; the picture book and the two rare books from the named kobolds there."] = "{npc:240}站在{area:87}狮王之傲旅店前。失落的书由{area:87}以南{area:57}的狗头人掉落；图画书和两本稀有书来自那里的有名狗头人。",
	["{npc:279}, in the {object:2096}"] = "{npc:279}，在{object:2096}里",
	["{npc:344} waits in the town hall of {area:69}."] = "{npc:344}在{area:69}的市政厅等候。",
	["{npc:448} is an elite gnoll west of {area:120}; at 60 he is no trouble. The Wanted poster hangs on the garrison."] = "{npc:448}是{area:120}以西的精英豺狼人；60级时不成问题。通缉令挂在要塞上。",
	["{npc:80}, deep in {area:34}"] = "{npc:80}，{area:34}深处",
	["{npc:951}, back at the abbey"] = "{npc:951}，回到修道院",
	["{npc:9562} at {area:2418}, in the south-east of the {zone:1428}, starts {quest:4183}: a chain to {area:69} and {object:2117}, 175 {faction:72} and 175 {zone:1457} reputation (level 54: in Classic four fifths of it at 60). The Black Broodlings and the {npc:7044} live on the slopes north of the Vigil; the {npc:7040} and {npc:7041} west of it, in the middle of the zone."] = "{zone:1428}东南{area:2418}的{npc:9562}会开启{quest:4183}：一条通往{area:69}和{object:2117}的任务链，175点{faction:72}和175点{zone:1457}声望（54级任务：经典版中60级时为五分之四）。黑色雏龙和{npc:7044}住在守夜营地以北的山坡；{npc:7040}和{npc:7041}在其以西、区域中部。",
	["{object:175894}, in the farmhouse"] = "{object:175894}，在农舍里",
	["{object:563442}, east of the abbey"] = "{object:563442}，修道院以东",
