	["{quest:5226}, +50"] = "{quest:5226}，+50",
	["{quest:7796}: 50 reputation for 20 {item:14047}, as often as you like. After the four first donations a non-Human stands at Friendly 700 of 6,000, so Honored is 5,300 away: 106 turn-ins, 2,120 {item:14047} (Humans start 900 higher: 88 turn-ins; a Skyborne's Exploring the Alliance paid 100, two fewer). The level 52-58 quests above take 23 turn-ins off; every Elwynn hub you did takes 20 to 30 more off if it paid in full. More quest hubs pay {faction:72}, in full while they are no more than 5 levels below you: {zone:1436} (about 2,500 in all), Redridge's {area:69} (about 3,000) and {zone:1431}'s {area:42} (about 2,900). Every city gain also gives a quarter as much to the other three Alliance cities (not counted here). Hand in all your {item:14047} at once."] = "{quest:7796}：每20个{item:14047}换50点声望，次数不限。四次首次捐献之后，非人类角色处于友善700/6000，所以距尊敬还差5300点：106次上交，2120个{item:14047}（人类起始高900点：88次上交；一位天裔的“探索联盟”给了100点，少两次）。上面的52-58级任务可抵掉23次；你每做一个艾尔文森林据点，若它全额给声望，还能再抵20到30次。还有更多据点给{faction:72}声望，在你高于其不超过5级时全额：{zone:1436}（共约2500）、赤脊山的{area:69}（约3000）和{zone:1431}的{area:42}（约2900）。每次城市声望收益还会给另外三座联盟城市四分之一的量（此处未计入）。把所有{item:14047}一次性上交。",
	["{quest:87} and the kelp"] = "{quest:87}与海藻",
}

