注意：豹子会潜行在区域里游荡。",
	["Ride south through the pass into the {area:3}' northern edge: the Stonevault troggs dig outside {area:1517} there. The carved urns and the magenta mushroom clusters sit in their caves and tunnels, outside the dungeon itself."] = "向南穿过山口进入{area:3}的北缘：石穹穴居人在那里的{area:1517}外挖掘。雕花瓮和紫红色蘑菇簇就在他们的洞穴和隧道里，位于副本之外。",
	["Ride south-east to the {area:355}, the stepped Vilebranch temple in the south of the {zone:1425}, and climb to the top. Qiaga and {npc:8636} (elite, 50) stand up there: touch the top and come straight back down.
Careful: Elite trolls guard the top platform, including {npc:7996} and {npc:8636}, along with several Vilebranch Soothsayers. The soothsayers cast spells and are linked to the rest of the group."] = "向东南骑到{area:355}，即{zone:1425}南部层层叠叠的邪枝神庙，一路爬顶层。琪亚加和{npc:8636}（精英，50级）驻守在那里：摸到顶部就立刻折返。
注意：精英巨魔守卫顶层平台，包括{npc:7996}和{npc:8636}，还有几名邪枝预言者。预言者会施法，并与同组其他成员联动。",
	["Ride west: Starving Snickerfangs roam the dry hills just south of the bloodmages' camp; Scorpok Stingers (level 50) scuttle across the middle of the north. {npc:5982} vultures circle over all of it. Pull one at a time.
