注意：斯科普克刺蝎会使用{spell:5416}；{npc:8301}会附带击倒。",
	["The bloodmages' camp is the first stop beside the road into the {area:4}, north-west of {area:1438}."] = "血法师营地是通往{area:4}的路旁第一个落脚点，位于{area:1438}西北。",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:1494} (level 52 elite) needs a group of 2. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."] = "这些是精英怪：建议组队，找人一起做。{npc:1494}（52级精英）需要2人组队。独自一人时跳过：路线里安排了刷怪补回经验。",
