	["Cavalier Durgen"] = "骑士杜根",
	["Climb the hill west of {area:190} to look down on the town.
Careful: Sentinels posted at the gate can detect stealthed players. Additional sentinels are found within the town, and an elite walks a patrol route nearby."] = "登上{area:190}西边的山丘，俯瞰小镇。
注意：驻守大门的哨兵能发现潜行的玩家。镇内还有更多哨兵，附近有一名精英沿巡逻路线行走。",
	["Collie is up the hill behind it."] = "科利在它后面的山上。",
	["Cross the river east to the {area:2261}, the crypt in the south-west of the zone. The {object:177667} lies inside: its key is on {npc:12248} in the far north-east, done in the next guide."] = "向东过河到{area:2261}，即区域西南的墓穴。{object:177667}就在里面：钥匙在遥远东北方的{npc:12248}身上，下一份攻略会处理。",
	["Cross the south of the crater to {npc:9619} by the ramp."] = "穿过环形山南部，到斜坡旁的{npc:9619}。",
	["Diseased Grizzly"] = "患病灰熊",
	["Diseased Wolf"] = "患病狼",
	["Dredge Crusher"] = "挖掘粉碎者",
	["Dredge Crushers dig further west; Stonelash Pincers, Flayers and Rock Stalkers hunt the same sands."] = "挖掘粉碎者在更西边挖掘；石鞭钳虫、石鞭撕掠者和岩石潜伏者在同一片沙地上狩猎。",
	["Dredge Striker"] = "挖掘打击者",
