{npc:11140}站在{area:2627}中{npc:12384}的小屋旁。",
	["Ride out of the crater's north-western pass into {area:1377} and on to {area:3425}. {npc:15189} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "从环形山西北山口骑出，进入{area:1377}，再前往{area:3425}。{npc:15189}站在他建筑的楼上：从里面上楼，箭头无法分辨楼层。",
	["Ride south-west to {npc:7771}'s camp at the {area:1938}."] = "向西南骑到{area:1938}旁{npc:7771}的营地。",
	["Ride west past {area:541} and south down the western side to {area:543}: {npc:10302} the goblin sits by the water."] = "向西骑过{area:541}，沿西侧南下到{area:543}：地精{npc:10302}坐在水边。",
	["Scarlet Hunter"] = "血色猎人",
