	["Skeletal Flayer"] = "骷髅撕掠者",
	["Skeletal Flayers and Slavering Ghouls roam the fields north of the camp; all the Scourge here drop Scourgestones.
Careful: These undead notice you from far away, and other undead nearby join the fight when one is pulled.
Careful: The {npc:10411} (3 spawns, 15 min respawn) turns invisible when out of combat and calls in Rockwing Gargoyles once a fight starts."] = "骷髅撕掠者和流涎食尸鬼在营地北面的田野游荡；这里的天灾怪都会掉落天灾石。
