注意：{npc:10411}（3个刷新点，15分钟刷新）脱离战斗后会隐形，战斗一开始就会呼叫石翼石像鬼。",
	["Slavering Ghoul"] = "流涎食尸鬼",
	["Sprinkle"] = "斯普林克",
	["Tar Beasts wallow in the {area:538}; the fire elementals of {area:537} in the middle carry the ash; the Gorishi wasps of the {area:540} in the south carry the gland. Every creature in the crater can drop {item:11018}.
Careful: Gorishi Workers that drop below 45% health have a 50% chance to call for help from allies within 25 yd."] = "焦油兽在{area:538}里打滚；中部{area:537}的火元素携带着灰烬；南部{area:540}的格里什黄蜂携带着腺体。环形山里的每种生物都可能掉落{item:11018}。
注意：生命值降到45%以下的格里什工蜂有50%几率呼叫25码内的同伴支援。",
	["Temporal Parasite"] = "时间寄生虫",
	["The crater"] = "环形山",
	["The gorillas live on {area:1943}, east of {area:541}. Keep their pelts for {npc:9619}. Stay out of the deepest cave: {npc:9622} is level 55.
