	["{npc:11613} walks the Northridge camp east of {npc:11610}; {npc:11611} guards the tower at {area:190}'s southern approach.
Careful: Guards stand at the tower's base and one more circles it on patrol. Clear them before you engage Durgen so they don't join the fight."] = "{npc:11613}在{npc:11610}东边的北岭营地巡逻；{npc:11611}守卫着{area:190}南侧入口的哨塔。
