G["forever/class/mage/astral-knot-garment"] = {
	["A robe or a blouse for Alliance mages in their late 20s."] = "适合20级后期联盟法师的长袍或上衣。",
	["Head east through {zone:1429} into Redridge, or fly to {area:69}. The {area:96} stands alone in the east of the zone. Climb to the very top floor (not the one below): the treatise is the book sticking out of the shelf where the stairs come up. Two gnoll dogs and a gnoll caster guard the shelf; the dogs' {spell:2691} interrupts the click, so fight them on the stairs out of their sight. Morganth (level 26 elite) stands across the top floor: you do not need him, keep to the left edge of the ramp so he stays put. The book is back two seconds after anyone takes it. If you die, your ghost can run up and come back to life beside it."] = "向东穿过{zone:1429}进入赤脊山，或飞往{area:69}。{area:96}孤立在区域东部。爬到最高层（不是下面那层）：论文就是从楼梯上来处书架上露出的那本书。两只豺狼人猎犬和一名豺狼人施法者看守书架；猎犬的{spell:2691}会打断点击，所以在楼梯上避开它们视线战斗。摩根斯（26级精英）站在顶层对面：你不需要他，贴着斜坡左边缘走，让他待在原地。任何人拿走书后两秒书就会刷新。如果你死了，你的鬼魂可以跑上去，在书旁复活。",
	["Mage"] = "法师",
	["You do not need a letter: at 26 climb the Wizard's Sanctum, the violet tower of {zone:1453}'s {object:2101}. {npc:5694} waits on the spiral walkway, just past the door of the portal room near the top, and has the quest for you. ({npc:5497} may also offer you {npc:5694}, the pointer quest; it is only a pointer and you can skip it.)"] = "你不需要信：26级时爬上巫师圣殿，即{zone:1453}的{object:2101}中的紫色高塔。{npc:5694}在螺旋回廊上等候，就在靠近顶部的传送门房间门外，会给你任务。（{npc:5497}也可能把{npc:5694}——指引任务——交给你；它只是指引，可以跳过。）",
	["{area:492} in western {zone:1431}: the six Carrion Recluses (level 25-26, green, {spell:3609}) walk the graves, the central statue and the riverbank, and every one drops a silk; they come back after 5 minutes. The Black Widow Hatchlings (24-25) on the slopes east of the cemetery drop it about one time in six, so mix them in while you wait. {npc:522}, a level 35 elite skeleton, walks the cemetery: watch for him."] = "{zone:1431}西部的{area:492}：六只食腐隐士（25-26级，绿色，{spell:3609}）在坟墓、中央雕像和河岸游荡，每只都会掉落一块丝绸；5分钟后刷新。墓园东边斜坡上的黑寡妇幼蛛（24-25级）约六次掉一次，所以等待时可以混着刷。35级精英骷髅{npc:522}在墓园巡逻：小心他。",
	["{npc:1309} works at {object:23296} in the {object:2101}. The robe gives intellect, stamina and spirit; the blouse more intellect and stamina but no spirit."] = "{npc:1309}在{object:2101}内的{object:23296}处工作。长袍提供智力、耐力和精神；上衣提供更多智力和耐力，但没有精神。",
	["{npc:5497} stands at the top of the Wizard's Sanctum, the violet tower of the {object:2101}; the portal near the top of the spiral ramp takes you to her."] = "{npc:5497}站在巫师圣殿的顶部，即{object:2101}的紫色高塔；螺旋斜坡靠近顶部的传送门会把你送到她那里。",
	["{npc:5694} (Skyborne)"] = "{npc:5694}（天裔）",
	["{quest:1939} waits on the spiral walkway of the Wizard's Sanctum, just past the door of the portal room as you walk down from the trainers."] = "{quest:1939}在巫师圣殿的螺旋回廊上等候，就在你从训练师那里往下走时经过的传送门房间门外。",
}

