	["While you're here: learn Staves from {npc:11867} ({object:2096}, 10 silver); a Hunter's melee weapon is mostly its stats, and two-handers carry the most."] = "趁在这里：向{npc:11867}学习法杖（{object:2096}，10银）；猎人的近战武器主要看属性，双手武器提供的属性最多。",
	["While you're here: learn Swords from {npc:11867} ({object:2096}, 10 silver); a sword in the main hand levels a Rogue steadily."] = "趁在这里：向{npc:11867}学习剑类武器（{object:2096}，10银）；主手持剑让潜行者练级更平稳。",
	["While you're here: learn {spell:202} from {npc:11867} ({object:2096}, 10 silver); two-handers level a Warrior fastest."] = "趁在这里：向{npc:11867}学习{spell:202}（{object:2096}，10银）；双手武器让战士练级最快。",
