G["forever/alliance/50-60/03-winterspring"] = {
	["Back to the hills: only the Ice Thistle Matriarchs and Patriarchs carry the horns. Keep killing yetis until level 54: Harlo's wildkin quests are red before that."] = "回到丘陵：只有冰蓟母熊和公熊带着角。继续杀雪人直到54级：在此之前，哈洛的枭兽任务都是红色的。",
