	["{npc:1243} camps south-west of it, by the road to Coldridge."] = "{npc:1243}在它西南扎营，靠近去冷岭的路。",
	["{npc:1266} camps in {area:801}, south of the road back east from Brewnall to {area:131}. His meats are in the locker in {npc:1271}'s cave, east of his camp. {npc:1271} is an elite yeti: wait out of sight until he wanders off on his patrol, then take the meats and leave before he comes back. You don't need to fight him."] = "{npc:1266}在{area:801}扎营，位于从布伦诺尔向东返回{area:131}的道路以南。他的肉在{npc:1271}洞穴的冷藏柜里，在营地以东。{npc:1271}是精英雪人：躲起来等他巡逻走开，然后拿走肉，在他回来前离开。不需要和他战斗。",
