	["{npc:1373} guards the {item:2686} barrels in the distillery basement. Buy a {item:2686} from {npc:1247}, click the guarded barrel, then hand the ale to {npc:1373} from his quest window (there is no quest to accept); after that, the unguarded barrel takes the {spell:8553}."] = "{npc:1373}看守酿酒厂地下室的{item:2686}酒桶。先从{npc:1247}买一份{item:2686}，点击有守卫的酒桶，然后在{npc:1373}的任务窗口把酒交给他（没有任务可接）；之后，没有守卫的那个酒桶就能接受{spell:8553}了。",
	["{npc:1373}, beside the barrel; below ground"] = "{npc:1373}，在酒桶旁；地下",
