Then go in: {npc:6806}, the innkeeper, {npc:1226} and {npc:1267}. {npc:1699}'s {skill:185} lesson waits for the return with the ribs, when the copper is there for it."] = "{npc:1872}在酿酒厂西边的铁匠铺干活。
然后进去：旅店老板{npc:6806}、{npc:1226}和{npc:1267}。{npc:1699}的{skill:185}课程要等你带着肋排回来才教，那时铜币也够了。",
	["{npc:1960} waits at the {area:808}, north of the South Gate; the dwarven corpse lies up the pass to the west of him."] = "{npc:1960}在南门以北的{area:808}等候；矮人尸体就在他西边的山道上方。",
