	["The shrine lies in the south-west corner of {area:16}, south of {area:3137}."] = "神龛位于{area:16}的西南角，{area:3137}以南。",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:7977} (level 48 elite) needs a group of 2. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."] = "这些是精英怪：建议组队，找人一起做。{npc:7977}（48级精英）需要2人组队。如果你独自一人就跳过：路线会让你把经验刷回来。",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:9461} is a level 54 elite: most classes solo it at level 56, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."] = "这些是精英怪：建议组队，找人一起做。{npc:9461}是54级精英：大多数职业在56级可以单挑，但你可能需要帮助。如果你独自一人就跳过：路线会让你把经验刷回来。",
	["To {area:2101}"] = "前往{area:2101}",
	["Top up here to level 50.89 before the hand-ins at {zone:1426}: they take you to level 51."] = "在交{zone:1426}的任务之前在这里补到50.89级：这些任务会把你带到51级。",
	["Top up here to level 51.39 before the hand-ins at {area:251}: they take you to level 52."] = "在交{area:251}的任务之前在这里补到51.39级：这些任务会把你带到52级。",
