	["{area:2418} flight master"] = "{area:2418}飞行管理员",
	["{area:2418} sits in the south-east of the Steppes, at the top of the pass up from Redridge."] = "{area:2418}位于燃烧平原东南部，在从赤脊山上来那条山道的顶端。",
