G["forever/alliance/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale"] = {
	["\"Sea Wolf\" MacKinley, on the top floor"] = "“海狼”麦金利，在顶层",
	["Arbor Tarantula"] = "树栖狼蛛",
	["At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. Skyborne learn it from {npc:265756}, the stablemaster and riding trainer at the {area:17684} in {area:16638} on Zephras Isle, who also sells the Galestriders: the skyboat to the isle leaves the north side of {area:279} about every five minutes. Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists the Galestriders."] = "40级时花100金就能学骑术，学会后可获得一匹坐骑。天裔在泽弗拉斯岛{area:16638}的{area:17684}向驯兽师兼骑术训练师{npc:265756}学习，他还出售风行者：前往该岛的天艇大约每五分钟从{area:279}北侧出发。收藏·坐骑·40级列出了风行者。",
	["At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. {npc:4732} teaches Humans at {area:88} in eastern {area:12}, beside {npc:384}'s horses. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (unconfirmed). Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists every colour."] = "40级时花100金就能学骑术，学会后可获得一匹坐骑。{npc:4732}在{area:12}东部的{area:88}教人类，就在{npc:384}的马匹旁。Forever可能允许任何种族向任何骑术训练师学习（未经证实）。收藏·坐骑·40级列出了所有颜色。",
	["At 40 with 100 gold you can learn to ride, and learning it gives you a mount. {npc:4753} teaches Night Elves in {zone:1457}, beside {npc:4730}'s sabers: the boat from {area:17203} to {area:442}, then the flight to {area:702}. Forever may let any race learn from any riding trainer (unconfirmed), such as {npc:4732} at {area:88} in {area:12}. Collectibles, Mounts · Level 40 lists every colour."] = "40级时花100金就能学骑术，学会后可获得一匹坐骑。{npc:4753}在{zone:1457}教暗夜精灵，就在{npc:4730}的刃豹旁：从{area:17203}坐船到{area:442}，再飞往{area:702}。Forever可能允许任何种族向任何骑术训练师学习（未经证实），例如{area:12}中{area:88}的{npc:4732}。收藏·坐骑·40级列出了所有颜色。",
	["Back in Theramore: Tervosh waits with Lady Jaina in the tower of {area:514}."] = "回到塞拉摩：特沃什和吉安娜女士在{area:514}的塔里等你。",
	["Bloodsail Swashbuckler"] = "血帆剑客",
	["Boat to {area:150}"] = "乘船前往{area:150}",
	["Boat to {area:17203}"] = "乘船前往{area:17203}",
	["Fly to {area:144}"] = "飞往{area:144}",
	["Fly to {area:1537}"] = "飞往{area:1537}",
	["Fly to {area:35}"] = "飞往{area:35}",
	["Fly to {area:42}"] = "飞往{area:42}",
	["Fly to {area:442}"] = "飞往{area:442}",
	["Fly to {area:702}"] = "飞往{area:702}",
	["Fly to {zone:1453}"] = "飞往{zone:1453}",
	["Follow the road north-west out of Theramore to the watchtower at {area:503}. Mudrock Burrowers roam the marsh around it."] = "沿路向西北离开塞拉摩，前往{area:503}的瞭望塔。泥岩掘地者在塔周围的沼泽里游荡。",
	["If you skipped {quest:193}, grind here to level 42.23 to stay on the route's plan."] = "如果你跳过了{quest:193}，就在这里刷到42.23级，以跟上本路线的进度规划。",
	["If you skipped {quest:196}, grind here to level 42.27 to stay on the route's plan."] = "如果你跳过了{quest:196}，就在这里刷到42.27级，以跟上本路线的进度规划。",
	["If you skipped {quest:208}, grind here to level 42.33 to stay on the route's plan."] = "如果你跳过了{quest:208}，就在这里刷到42.33级，以跟上本路线的进度规划。",
	["If you skipped {quest:543}, grind here to level 42.46 to stay on the route's plan."] = "如果你跳过了{quest:543}，就在这里刷到42.46级，以跟上本路线的进度规划。",
	["Inside"] = "室内",
	["Into {area:10}"] = "进入{area:10}",
	["Into {area:12}"] = "进入{area:12}",
	["Into {area:8}"] = "进入{area:8}",
	["Into {zone:1430}"] = "进入{zone:1430}",
	["Into {zone:1453}"] = "进入{zone:1453}",
	["Jungle Stalker"] = "丛林潜伏者",
	["Level 42.23"] = "42.23级",
	["Level 42.27"] = "42.27级",
	["Level 42.33"] = "42.33级",
	["Level 42.46"] = "42.46级",
	["On the top floor"] = "在顶层",
	["Ride south out of {zone:1432} through the pass into the {area:3}; {npc:2860} camps at the dig."] = "骑马向南离开{zone:1432}，穿过山口进入{area:3}；{npc:2860}在挖掘场扎营。",
	["Riding and Galestriders: {npc:265756}, at the {area:17684} in {area:16638} on Zephras Isle."] = "骑术与风行者：{npc:265756}，在泽弗拉斯岛{area:16638}的{area:17684}。",
	["Skyboat to Zephras Isle: the north side of {area:279}, about every five minutes."] = "前往泽弗拉斯岛的天艇：{area:279}北侧，大约每五分钟一班。",
	["Stormwind City"] = "暴风城",
	["The Darkmist spiders nest around the cavern in the north-west of the marsh; every spider drops eyes.
Careful: Darkmist Lurkers move about stealthed and use poison once in combat. The spiders stand close together, so adds are common; pulling single targets from the outer edge cuts down on them."] = "暗雾蜘蛛在沼泽西北的洞穴周围结巢；每种蜘蛛都掉眼睛。
注意：暗雾潜伏者潜行移动，进入战斗后会使用毒。蜘蛛站得很近，很容易多拉怪；从外围一次拉一只可以减少额外怪。",
	["The Skullsplitter trolls hold the ruins just east of the mine; any of them can drop tusks, their panthers always do.
Follow the road north-east to the Venture Co. camp at the {area:310}; the miners, surveyors and foremen drop the crystals.
Careful: Stealthed Shadowmaw Panthers and Stranglethorn Tigresses roam the area around the camp."] = "劈颅者巨魔占据着矿场以东的废墟；其中任何一个都可能掉獠牙，他们的黑豹必掉。
沿路向东北前往{area:310}的风险投资公司营地；矿工、勘测员和工头掉落水晶。
注意：潜行的影颚黑豹和荆棘谷母虎在营地周围活动。",
	["The burned inn stands on the road west, toward the {area:17}; the guard's badge lies in the ashes and the hoofprints are in the mud beside the inn."] = "烧毁的旅店在向西通往{area:17}的路上；卫兵的徽章在灰烬里，蹄印在旅店旁的泥地里。",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:728} is a level 40 elite: most classes solo it at level 42, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."] = "这些是精英怪：建议组队，找人来一起做。{npc:728}是40级精英：大多数职业42级可以单挑，但可能需要帮忙。如果只有你一个人就跳过：路线会安排你刷怪补经验。",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:730} is a level 43 elite: most classes solo it at level 45, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."] = "这些是精英怪：建议组队，找人来一起做。{npc:730}是43级精英：大多数职业45级可以单挑，但可能需要帮忙。如果只有你一个人就跳过：路线会安排你刷怪补经验。",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:731} is a level 43 elite: most classes solo it at level 45, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
Careful: Tigers and stealthed shadowmaw panthers roam close to him. Clear them before you pull him. When he is pulled, {npc:731} calls for help from creatures within 20 yd."] = "这些是精英怪：建议组队，找人来一起做。{npc:731}是43级精英：大多数职业45级可以单挑，但可能需要帮忙。如果只有你一个人就跳过：路线会安排你刷怪补经验。
注意：老虎和潜行的影颚黑豹在他附近游荡。拉他之前先清掉。开打后，{npc:731}会向20码内的生物呼救。",
	["Tram to {zone:1455}"] = "乘地铁去{zone:1455}",
