G["forever/class/rogue/poisons-alliance"] = {
	["/lay with the Doc targeted"] = "选中医生后输入 /lay",
	["All four are in {zone:1453}. {item:3421}: Bernard or {npc:1303}'s flower shop by the {object:2096} canal. A {item:3372}: many general goods and alchemy vendors ({npc:1257}, {npc:1325} and others). A {item:4371}: an engineering supplier, who keeps only a few (or an engineer or the Auction House). The {item:8431} lies on the floor beside the left end of the counter in {object:2177}, the tailor's shop on the canals; you can only pick it up with this quest. If you skip the cure, an {item:6452} ({skill:129}) or a druid's {spell:526} also clears the {spell:9810}."] = "这四样都在{zone:1453}。{item:3421}：伯纳德或{npc:1303}的花店，在{object:2096}运河旁。{item:3372}：许多杂货和炼金商人（{npc:1257}、{npc:1325}等）有售。{item:4371}：工程学供应商，存货很少（或者找工程师，或去拍卖行）。{item:8431}在运河边裁缝店{object:2177}柜台左端旁的地上；只有接了这个任务才能拾取。如果不做解毒，{item:6452}（{skill:129}）或德鲁伊的{spell:526}也能解除{spell:9810}。",
	["At 20 {npc:332}, upstairs in the SI:7 building in {object:2100}, sends you to {npc:7024} in {zone:1436}. This chain is how you learn Poisons on Forever, so do not skip it."] = "20级时，{object:2100}军情七处大楼楼上的{npc:332}会派你去{zone:1436}找{npc:7024}。在 Forever 上，毒药就是通过这条任务链学会的，别跳过。",
	["Forever teaches Poisons through this chain, not the trainer; the {item:7676} recipe comes with it."] = "在 Forever 里，毒药是通过这条任务链学会的，训练师不教；{item:7676}的配方也随任务一并获得。",
	["Get the key first. The {npc:7051} (level 23, not elite) starts at the tower entrance and walks a loop around the outside; it is the spiky-haired one trailing yellow sparkles. Stealth up and {spell:921} it from behind: it always has the key. It hits hard: if stealth breaks, {spell:2983} away. Watch for the pair of Defias Drones that also patrol."] = "先拿钥匙。{npc:7051}（23级，非精英）从塔楼入口出发，沿外围绕圈；就是那个留着尖刺头发、身后拖着黄色闪光的。潜行过去，从背后用{spell:921}偷它：它总是带着钥匙。它打得很疼：如果潜行被打破，就用{spell:2983}跑开。注意也会巡逻的一对迪菲亚雄蜂。",
	["Head north through Elwynn to {zone:1453}; Mathias Shaw is upstairs in SI:7. He teaches Poisons and gives you the {item:7676} recipe. Poisons are made, not bought: each batch of {item:6947} takes a {item:2928} and an {item:3371}, which {npc:1325} and {npc:1326} sell in {object:2100} next to SI:7. Buy a stack of each, open Poisons from your spellbook to make them, then use a poison on your weapon."] = "穿过艾尔文森林向北到{zone:1453}；马迪亚斯·肖尔在军情七处楼上。他教毒药，并给你{item:7676}的配方。毒药是做的，不是买的：每批{item:6947}需要{item:2928}和{item:3371}，{npc:1325}和{npc:1326}在军情七处旁的{object:2100}有售。各买一组，从法术书里打开毒药制作，然后给武器涂上毒药。",
	["Kearnen hides stealthed against the west side of a big tree with two small trees in front of it, just north of {npc:7053}'s Defias tower in the far east of {zone:1436}, by the {zone:1431} border. Read {item:8046} for the tower's layout if you like."] = "凯尔南潜行躲在一棵大树西侧，树前有两棵小树，就在{zone:1436}最东边{npc:7053}的迪菲亚塔楼以北、靠近{zone:1431}边界的地方。想看塔楼布局的话，读{item:8046}。",
	["Klaven's journal"] = "克拉文的手记",
	["Poisons (Alliance)"] = "毒药（联盟）",
	["Rogue"] = "潜行者",
	["Sneak up the tower. Defias Tower Patrollers (23) and Sentries (24) guard the floors; an Ambush with a dagger kills them outright if you would rather clear them. {npc:7053}, a level 26 elite, waits on the top floor: Sap him, or bring a friend. The {object:123214} beside his desk needs Lockpicking of about 70-75 (practise on the boxes at {area:97} in Redridge first). A trick: while the Sentries are away, jump from the chair to the lamp to the bookshelf above the chest, step out of stealth and open the chest from there. Opening it poisons you with the {spell:9810}, which stops your stealth for a while and lets the drone see you; that is why the key comes first. Then get out."] = "潜行上塔。迪菲亚塔楼巡逻者（23级）和哨兵（24级）守在各层；如果想清掉他们，用匕首伏击能直接秒杀。{npc:7053}，26级精英，在顶层等着：闷棍他，或者带个同伴。他桌子旁的{object:123214}需要约70-75点开锁（先在赤脊山{area:97}的箱子上练手）。小技巧：趁哨兵走开时，从椅子跳到灯，再跳到箱子上方的书架，脱离潜行，从那里开箱子。打开它会使你中{spell:9810}的毒，一段时间内无法潜行，雄蜂就会看到你；所以要先去拿钥匙。然后离开。",
	["The {item:7923}"] = "{item:7923}",
	["{item:7908}: the {object:123214}, top floor"] = "{item:7908}：{object:123214}，顶层",
	["{item:7923}: {spell:921} the {npc:7051}"] = "{item:7923}：对{npc:7051}使用{spell:921}",
	["{npc:332}: Poisons"] = "{npc:332}：毒药",
	["{quest:2607} still sits on you. {npc:7207} works in the cellar of the SI:7 building: the stairs down are under the stairs to the upper floor, behind {npc:1325}. Target him and type /lay (nothing after it) to be examined, then wait. If he does nothing, abandon the quest, take it again and wait until he asks you to lie down."] = "{quest:2607}还在你身上。{npc:7207}在军情七处大楼的地窖里工作：下去的楼梯在通往楼上的楼梯下面，{npc:1325}身后。选中他，输入 /lay（后面不要加任何内容）让他检查，然后等着。如果他什么都不做，放弃任务，再接一次，等到他让你躺下。",
}

G["forever/class/warlock/dread-mage-hat"] = {
	["A cloth hat in your late 20s: Zardeth's errand for any Alliance player pays warlocks this extra."] = "二十多级后期的一顶布帽：扎尔迪斯给任何联盟玩家的差事，会给术士这份额外奖励。",
	["At 25 {npc:1435}, in the cellar of the {object:2164} in the {object:2101} (beside the warlock trainers), wants two ingredients for a brew. Do it when your leveling takes you to {zone:1431} and the {zone:1437}."] = "25级时，{object:2101}里{object:2164}的地窖中（术士训练师旁）的{npc:1435}要两种材料来配药。等你练级到{zone:1431}和{zone:1437}时再做。",
	["Back to Zardeth once more: he offers warlocks a reward, which his imp {npc:1733}, standing beside him, hands over."] = "再次回到扎尔迪斯：他给术士一份奖励，由他身旁的小鬼{npc:1733}交给你。",
	["Back to Zardeth. He brews the {item:2788} and gives it to you for {npc:1439} in the Hall of Petitioners, the first hall on the right inside {object:2117}."] = "回到扎尔迪斯。他酿好{item:2788}交给你，再拿去给{object:2117}内右侧第一个大厅——请愿者大厅——里的{npc:1439}。",
	["The root grows at the water's edge in the pool below the small falls east of {area:836}, beside the {object:147516} cave below the {area:146}: a tall, spiky wooden root, not at the foot of the dam itself."] = "根生长在{area:836}东边小瀑布下池塘的水边，在{area:146}下方{object:147516}洞穴旁：一根高大、带尖刺的木根，不在水坝脚下。",
	["Warlock"] = "术士",
	["{area:1098} stands in the north-east of {zone:1431}, north of {area:42}. The {object:321} is a small white flower low in the grass of the fenced garden beside Stalvan's house: hard to see, so sweep the garden with your mouse. Fetid Corpses (level 29) wander the grounds and come quickly: at 25, send your voidwalker at the nearest one, grab the flower and leave. {npc:315} (32) is inside the house; leave him alone."] = "{area:1098}在{zone:1431}东北、{area:42}以北。{object:321}是一朵小白花，低低地长在斯塔文房子旁围栏花园的草丛里：很难看见，用鼠标在花园里扫一遍。腐臭的尸体（29级）在院子里游荡，来得很快：25级时派虚空行者去最近的尸体，采花后离开。{npc:315}（32级）在屋里；别惹他。",
}

G["forever/collectibles/mounts/alliance/mechanostrider"] = {
	["Any Alliance race can buy these mechanostriders, but riding one also takes {spell:10907}, which only Gnomes get with {skill:762}. {npc:7954} teaches it to other races once they are Exalted with {faction:54} (the Gnomeregan Exiles Reputation guide shows the way). Until then, don't buy a mechanostrider for this character."] = "任何联盟种族都能买这些机械陆行鸟，但骑乘还需要{spell:10907}，只有侏儒通过{skill:762}才能获得。其他种族在{faction:54}达到崇拜后，{npc:7954}会教他们（诺莫瑞根流亡者声望指南有详细路线）。在此之前，别给这个角色买机械陆行鸟。",
	["In Classic only Dwarves and Gnomes could ride mechanostriders; in Forever every Alliance race can learn {spell:10907}."] = "经典旧世里只有矮人和侏儒能骑机械陆行鸟；在 Forever 里所有联盟种族都能学会{spell:10907}。",
	["{area:189} is just east of {area:131}; {npc:7954} stands beside {npc:7955}'s mechanostriders. At 40 {npc:7954} teaches {skill:762} to Gnomes for 100g (10% less at Honored with {faction:54}), and it comes with a mechanostrider. Other races learn {skill:762}, with their own first mount, at their own race's riding trainer."] = "{area:189}就在{area:131}以东；{npc:7954}站在{npc:7955}的机械陆行鸟旁。40级时{npc:7954}以100金教侏儒{skill:762}（在{faction:54}尊敬时便宜10%），还附赠一只机械陆行鸟。其他种族在自己种族的骑术训练师那里学习{skill:762}，并获得自己的第一只坐骑。",
	["{spell:10907} for other races"] = "其他种族的{spell:10907}",
}

G["forever/collectibles/pets/shylenai"] = {
	["{npc:8665}, the owl trainer, stands on the {area:1659} in {zone:1457}, beside the food and general goods vendors. She sells three owls (50s each); the {item:280803} is new in Forever. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards."] = "{npc:8665}，猫头鹰训练师，站在{zone:1457}的{area:1659}，在食品和杂货商旁。她出售三种猫头鹰（每只50银）；{item:280803}是 Forever 新增的。每个宠物物品使用后都会教会对应的小伙伴；目标完成后仍保持勾选。",
}

G["forever/reputation/gnomeregan-exiles"] = {
	["400 {area:133} reputation from {npc:9616}'s ooze jars and {quest:4262} (level 52-54)"] = "{npc:9616}的软泥瓶和{quest:4262}（52-54级）带来的400点{area:133}声望",
	["About 3,000 {area:133} reputation from low-level quests in {zone:1426}, paid to {zone:1455} too (in Classic, a fifth of it at 60)"] = "约3,000点{area:133}声望来自{zone:1426}的低级任务，同时也会给{zone:1455}（经典旧世里60级时只有五分之一）",
	["Burly Rockjaw Trogg"] = "强壮的石颚穴居人",
	["Cloth, {npc:9616}'s ooze quests and the {zone:1426} hubs, which pay {zone:1455} too: best done while leveling."] = "布匹、{npc:9616}的软泥任务和{zone:1426}的各任务点，同时也会给{zone:1455}：最好在练级时做。",
	["Coldridge: on to {area:131}"] = "寒脊山谷：前往{area:131}",
	["Coldridge: the hot Mornbrew"] = "寒脊山谷：滚烫的晨酿",
	["Coldridge: wolves, troggs and {npc:8416}'s things"] = "寒脊山谷：狼、穴居人和{npc:8416}的东西",
	["Coldridge: {area:77} and {npc:714}"] = "寒脊山谷：{area:77}和{npc:714}",
	["Coldridge: {npc:786} and the troll cave"] = "寒脊山谷：{npc:786}和巨魔洞",
	["Dark Iron Spy"] = "黑铁间谍",
	["Elder Crag Boar"] = "老峭壁野猪",
	["Exalted with {faction:54}: in Classic, other races may buy the mechanostriders"] = "{faction:54}崇拜：经典旧世里其他种族可以购买机械陆行鸟",
	["Frostmane Headhunter"] = "霜鬃猎头者",
	["Frostmane Troll Whelp"] = "霜鬃巨魔幼崽",
	["Honored: in Classic the {faction:54}' vendors take 10% off for you, {npc:7955}'s mechanostriders (20g, the swift ones 200g) included; Forever has not settled it, and guide sites report 5% at Friendly rising to 20% at Exalted. Honored to Revered is 12,000 reputation: 240 turn-ins, 4,800 {item:14047}."] = "尊敬：经典旧世里{faction:54}的商人给你打九折，包括{npc:7955}的机械陆行鸟（20金，迅捷款200金）；Forever 还没有定论，攻略网站称友善时5%，崇拜时升到20%。尊敬到崇敬是12,000点声望：240次上交，4,800个{item:14047}。",
	["Ice Claw Bear"] = "冰爪熊",
	["Optional: eastern {zone:1426}, from {npc:264936}'s camp to the {area:134} and {area:803}, about 500 reputation (100 at a fifth) in 30 minutes at 60. In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. Skip this step to skip the hub."] = "可选：{zone:1426}东部，从{npc:264936}的营地到{area:134}和{area:803}，60级时30分钟约500点声望（按五分之一算是100）。经典旧世里，低于你6级以上的任务奖励更少（60级时为五分之一）；一份 Forever 测试报告称会全额发放。第一次上交就能看出是哪种：如果只给五分之一，就跳过这些任务点。跳过这一步就跳过该任务点。",
	["Optional: the Dwarf and Gnome start valley south-west of {area:131}, about 1,150 reputation (230 at a fifth) in 30 minutes at 60. {npc:658} and {npc:713} stand at {area:77}. In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. Skip this step to skip the hub."] = "可选：{area:131}西南的矮人与侏儒新手山谷，60级时30分钟约1,150点声望（按五分之一算是230）。{npc:658}和{npc:713}站在{area:77}。经典旧世里，低于你6级以上的任务奖励更少（60级时为五分之一）；一份 Forever 测试报告称会全额发放。第一次上交就能看出是哪种：如果只给五分之一，就跳过这些任务点。跳过这一步就跳过该任务点。",
	["Optional: {area:131} and the Brewnall and {area:133} roads around it, about 1,300 reputation (260 at a fifth) in 50 minutes at 60. Most givers stand in and around the {area:2102} and at {area:189} east of it. In Classic, quests 6+ levels below you pay less (a fifth at 60); a Forever beta report says they paid in full. Your first turn-in shows which: if it pays a fifth, skip these hubs. Skip this step to skip the hub."] = "可选：{area:131}以及周围布瑞恩诺尔和{area:133}的道路，60级时50分钟约1,300点声望（按五分之一算是260）。大多数任务发布者站在{area:2102}及其周边，以及它东边的{area:189}。经典旧世里，低于你6级以上的任务奖励更少（60级时为五分之一）；一份 Forever 测试报告称会全额发放。第一次上交就能看出是哪种：如果只给五分之一，就跳过这些任务点。跳过这一步就跳过该任务点。",
	["Overmaster Pyron"] = "至尊匹隆",
	["Reputation · Cities"] = "声望 · 城市",
	["Revered to Exalted is 21,000 reputation: 420 turn-ins, 8,400 {item:14047}. At Exalted, {npc:7955} at {area:189} in {zone:1426} sells her mechanostriders to other races in Classic; the Mechanostrider and Swift Mechanostrider guides cover them."] = "崇敬到崇拜是21,000点声望：420次上交，8,400个{item:14047}。崇拜后，经典旧世里{zone:1426}的{area:189}处{npc:7955}会把她的机械陆行鸟卖给其他种族；机械陆行鸟和迅捷机械陆行鸟指南有详细介绍。",
	["Rockjaw Bonesnapper"] = "石颚碎骨者",
	["Rockjaw Skullthumper"] = "石颚碎颅者",
	["Rockjaw Trogg"] = "石颚穴居人",
	["Small Crag Boar"] = "小型峭壁野猪",
	["Snow Leopard"] = "雪豹",
	["The Cursed and Tainted Oozes slide about the streams and fel pools around {area:1763} and {area:1765}: kill one and use an empty jar on its remains."] = "被诅咒的软泥怪和受污染的软泥怪在{area:1763}和{area:1765}周围的溪流和邪能水池里滑行：杀一只，在它的残骸上使用空瓶。",
	["The Dark Iron Spies lurk around Farsen's camp; the troggs dig in the {area:134}; {npc:1388}, a big snow leopard, prowls the hills above {area:803}."] = "黑铁间谍潜伏在法尔森营地附近；穴居人在{area:134}挖掘；{npc:1388}，一只大雪豹，在{area:803}上方的山丘游荡。",
	["The Primal Oozes live in the pools around {area:537} in the middle of the crater; the Muculent and Glutinous Oozes fill the jars too. Kill one and use a jar on its remains."] = "原始软泥怪生活在火山口中央{area:537}周围的水池里；黏液软泥怪和胶质软泥怪也能装满瓶子。杀一只，在它的残骸上使用瓶子。",
	["The Scalding Mornbrew cools in five minutes: run straight to {npc:836} at {area:77}."] = "滚烫的晨酿五分钟后就会凉：直接跑到{area:77}的{npc:836}那里。",
	["The boars and bears roam around {area:131}; the wendigos live in the {area:136} south-west of town; the leper gnomes at the {area:133} road carry the cogs and gears; Rumbleshot's ammo lies at his camp west of town."] = "野猪和熊在{area:131}周围游荡；温迪戈住在小镇西南的{area:136}；{area:133}路上的麻风侏儒带着齿轮和零件；朗布尔肖特的弹药在他的营地、小镇西边。",
	["The quarry and {area:803}"] = "采石场与{area:803}",
	["The quarry: troggs, spies and {npc:1388}"] = "采石场：穴居人、间谍和{npc:1388}",
	["The wolves roam the valley floor; the troggs dig in the camps east of {area:77}; {npc:8416}'s box, chest and bucket lie in the trogg camps."] = "狼在山谷底部游荡；穴居人在{area:77}东边的营地挖掘；{npc:8416}的箱子、木箱和水桶在穴居人营地里。",
	["walk to the back of the cave"] = "走到洞穴深处",
	["{area:131}: Brewnall and {quest:287}"] = "{area:131}：布瑞恩诺尔和{quest:287}",
	["{area:131}: back in town"] = "{area:131}：回到镇上",
	["{area:131}: last hand-in"] = "{area:131}：最后一次交任务",
	["{area:131}: the hills and the depot"] = "{area:131}：山丘与补给站",
	["{area:2418}: hand in"] = "{area:2418}：交任务",
	["{area:254} stands in the west of the {zone:1428}. {quest:4262}, a fire elemental, walks the lava paths inside it, near the door of {area:1584} but outside the dungeon: at 60 you take him alone."] = "{area:254}位于{zone:1428}西部。{quest:4262}，一个火元素，在里面的熔岩路径上走动，靠近{area:1584}门口但在副本外：60级时可以单挑他。",
	["{item:14047} drops from humanoids level 50 and up: the Scourge cultists and Scarlet Crusade in the Plaguelands, the Deadwood furbolgs of {zone:1448}, the Winterfall furbolgs of {zone:1452}. Keep any {item:14047} past the first 60 for {quest:7812}."] = "{item:14047}由50级及以上的人形怪掉落：瘟疫之地的天灾教徒和血色十字军、{zone:1448}的死木熊怪、{zone:1452}的冬泉熊怪。前60个之外的{item:14047}都留着给{quest:7812}。",
	["{item:2592}: troggs, gnolls and kobolds in {zone:1432} and the {zone:1437}"] = "{item:2592}：{zone:1432}和{zone:1437}的穴居人、豺狼人和狗头人",
	["{item:4306} drops from humanoids level 23 to 40: the Dragonmaw of the {zone:1437}, the Syndicate of Alterac and Arathi, Stranglethorn's trolls."] = "{item:4306}由23到40级的人形怪掉落：{zone:1437}的龙喉、奥特兰克和阿拉希的辛迪加、荆棘谷的巨魔。",
	["{item:4338} drops from humanoids level 35 to 50: the Shadowforge and {object:147516} dwarves of the {zone:1418} and {zone:1427}, the Dunemaul ogres of {zone:1446}, the Hatecrest naga of {zone:1444}."] = "{item:4338}由35到50级的人形怪掉落：{zone:1418}和{zone:1427}的暗炉和{object:147516}矮人、{zone:1446}的砂槌食人魔、{zone:1444}的憎恨之鳞纳迦。",
	["{npc:1252}, in {area:131}"] = "{npc:1252}，在{area:131}",
	["{npc:1274}, in the throne room"] = "{npc:1274}，在王座厅",
	["{npc:1374} stands by {area:137} on the lake north-west of {area:131}; {quest:287} is the troll cave west of it."] = "{npc:1374}站在{area:131}西北湖边{area:137}旁；{quest:287}在它西边的巨魔洞。",
	["{npc:14724} takes cloth for the {faction:54}; he stands in {object:171524} in {zone:1455}, by the tram. Each first donation of 60 Wool, Silk, Mageweave and {item:14047} pays 150 reputation once; after the {item:14047} one, {quest:7812} pays 50 for every 20 {item:14047}, as often as you like. The Auction House in the Commons is the quickest source of cloth. In Classic, quests pay full reputation while they are at most 5 levels below you, so do {zone:1426} (levels 1-12) and {npc:4077}'s quests in Stonetalon (20-25) while you level. After the donations come {npc:9616}'s ooze quests and {quest:4262} (400), then the optional {zone:1426} hubs, best rate first: {area:132} (about 38 a minute at full value), {area:131} (26), the quarry (17). Every {area:133} gain also gives a quarter as much to {zone:1453}, {zone:1455} and {zone:1457}, except quests in the level 1-10 start areas. Legacy Diplomat adds up to 10% to every gain."] = "{npc:14724}为{faction:54}收布；他站在{zone:1455}地铁旁的{object:171524}。首次各捐60个毛料、丝绸、魔纹布和{item:14047}，每次给150点声望；交完{item:14047}那次后，{quest:7812}每20个{item:14047}给50点，想交多少次都行。公共区的拍卖行是最快的布匹来源。经典旧世里，只要任务最多低于你5级，就按全额给声望，所以练级时做{zone:1426}（1-12级）和{npc:4077}在石爪山的任务（20-25级）。捐赠之后是{npc:9616}的软泥任务和{quest:4262}（400点），然后是可选{zone:1426}任务点，按效率从高到低：{area:132}（全额时每分钟约38）、{area:131}（26）、采石场（17）。每一份{area:133}声望收益还会以四分之一的比例给{zone:1453}、{zone:1455}和{zone:1457}，1-10级新手区的任务除外。传承外交官能让每份收益最多提高10%。",
	["{npc:14724}, the cloth quartermaster"] = "{npc:14724}，布匹军需官",
	["{npc:6806}, in the inn"] = "{npc:6806}，在旅店里",
	["{npc:786} camps south of {area:77}, at the mouth of the troll cave; the journal lies at the back of the cave."] = "{npc:786}在{area:77}以南扎营，就在巨魔洞口；手记在洞穴深处。",
	["{npc:9561} at {area:2418}, in the south-east of the {zone:1428}, wants {quest:4262} dead: 100 {area:133} reputation (level 52: in Classic 40 at 60). Her next quest, Incendius!, needs a {area:1584} group: 100 more, in full."] = "{npc:9561}在{area:2418}，位于{zone:1428}东南部，要{quest:4262}死：100点{area:133}声望（52级：经典旧世里60级时40点）。她的下一个任务“Incendius!”需要一个{area:1584}队伍：再给100点，全额。",
	["{npc:9616} in {object:171524} wants ooze samples for her research: 150 {area:133} reputation for each of her two quests (level 52 and 54: in Classic 60 and 120 of it at 60). She hands you the empty jars."] = "{object:171524}处的{npc:9616}要为研究收集软泥样本：她的两个任务（52级和54级）各给150点{area:133}声望（经典旧世里60级时分别是60点和120点）。她会把空瓶交给你。",
	["{object:171524}: hand in"] = "{object:171524}：交任务",
	["{object:171524}: the second jars"] = "{object:171524}：第二批瓶子",
	["{quest:4262}, +100"] = "{quest:4262}，+100",
	["{quest:4512}, +150"] = "{quest:4512}，+150",
	["{quest:7812}: 50 reputation for 20 {item:14047}, as often as you like. After the four first donations a Human, Dwarf or Night Elf stands at Friendly 700 of 6,000, so Honored is 5,300 away: 106 turn-ins, 2,120 {item:14047} (Gnomes start 900 higher: 88 turn-ins; Skyborne start at Neutral 2,000, so 6,400 away: 128, two fewer after Exploring the Alliance). {npc:9616}'s and {npc:9561}'s quests above take 8 turn-ins off; each {zone:1426} hub you did takes 10 to 26 more off if it paid in full. Outside Dun Morogh Gnomeregan pays little: {npc:4077}'s quests in Stonetalon (about 500) and {object:171524}'s {area:133} dungeon quests. Every city gain also gives a quarter as much to the other three Alliance cities (not counted here). Hand in all your {item:14047} at once."] = "{quest:7812}：每20个{item:14047}换50点声望，想交多少次都行。四次首次捐赠之后，人类、矮人或暗夜精灵处在友善700/6,000，离尊敬还差5,300点：106次上交、2,120个{item:14047}（侏儒初始高900点：88次；天裔从中立2,000开始，差6,400点：128次，做了“探索联盟”后少两次）。上面{npc:9616}和{npc:9561}的任务能减掉8次上交；你做过的每个{zone:1426}任务点，如果按全额给，还能再减10到26次。丹莫罗以外，诺莫瑞根的声望给得很少：{npc:4077}在石爪山的任务（约500点）和{object:171524}的{area:133}副本任务。每份主城声望收益还会以四分之一的比例给其他三个联盟主城（这里未计入）。把所有{item:14047}一次交清。",
	["{zone:1448}: Cursed and Tainted Oozes"] = "{zone:1448}：被诅咒的软泥怪和受污染的软泥怪",
	["{zone:1449}: Primal Oozes"] = "{zone:1449}：原始软泥怪",
}

