	["Level 48.27"] = "48.27级",
	["Level 48.66"] = "48.66级",
	["Level 48.98"] = "48.98级",
	["On the way"] = "途中",
	["Ride east across the Cauldron to the {area:247} in the south-east. The prisoner in the wooden outhouse wants 15 {item:4306} and eight dead Dark Iron Geologists from the dig site around it. The outhouse also opens with the key, if you found one.
The dwarf stands by the road at the dig site. When it is over, read the {object:175704} he leaves on the road in {area:1959}."] = "向东骑过火山口，前往东南的{area:247}。木制茅房里的囚犯要15个{item:4306}，以及其周围挖掘场里的八名黑铁地质学家。如果你找到了钥匙，茅房也可以用钥匙打开。
那名矮人站在挖掘场路边。结束后，阅读他留在{area:1959}路上的{object:175704}。",
	["The spiders roam the plateaus and lava pools in the south-west of the gorge.
Heavy War Golems patrol the floor of the Cauldron below Kalaran; Magma Elementals drift among them. Golems and elementals drop the oil, elementals the hearts.
Taskmasters and Slavers drive the slaves all over the Cauldron, and any of them can carry a {item:10551}. The Steamsmiths work at the furnaces in the middle (the {item:18959}), the Lookouts stand on the southern ridges (the Spyglass). Any {object:147516} may drop the {item:11818}: keep it.
Careful: Dark Iron Slavers (level 45-46) call for help from allies within 15 yd when pulled, cast Net from up to 15 yd, and use Rend in melee."] = "蜘蛛在峡谷西南的高地和熔岩池出没。
重型战争傀儡在卡拉兰下方的火山口地面上巡逻；岩浆元素在它们之间游荡。傀儡和元素掉落油，元素掉落心脏。
监工和奴隶贩子驱赶着奴隶遍布火山口，他们中的任何一个都可能携带{item:10551}。蒸汽铁匠在中央的熔炉干活（{item:18959}），瞭望员站在南边的山脊上（望远镜）。任何{object:147516}都可能掉落{item:11818}：留着。
注意：黑铁奴隶贩子（45-46级）被拉时向15码内的盟友求援，还会从最多15码外撒网，并在近战中使用撕裂。",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:14621} is a level 50 elite: most classes solo it at level 52, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."] = "这些是精英怪：建议组队，找人来一起做。{npc:14621}是50级精英：大多数职业52级可以单挑，但你可能需要帮忙。如果只有你一个人就跳过：路线会安排你刷怪补经验。",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {npc:5860} (level 50 elite) needs a group of 3. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."] = "这些是精英怪：建议组队，找人来一起做。{npc:5860}（50级精英）需要3人小队。如果只有你一个人就跳过：路线会安排你刷怪补经验。",
	["These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. {quest:3181} needs a group of 2. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back."] = "这些是精英怪：建议组队，找人来一起做。{quest:3181}需要2人小队。如果只有你一个人就跳过：路线会安排你刷怪补经验。",
	["To {area:2101}"] = "前往{area:2101}",
